| unix_time|from_unixtime(unix_time, yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss)|
+----------+---------------------------------------------+
|1428476400|                          2015-04-08 00:00:00|
+----------+---------------------------------------------+
spark.conf.unset("spark.sql.session.timeZone")
